OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax revaluation to be
OL,4,Adelayed in Wales to 2032
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' finance minister has said the
OL,7,FWelsh government intends to delay a
OL,8,Frevaluation of homes for council tax to
OL,9,F2032.
OL,11,FElin Jones said on Tuesday she could
OL,12,Fnot afford the kind of financial relief
OL,13,Fshe would want to put in place if she
OL,14,Fwent ahead with a planned 2028
OL,15,Frevaluation.
OL,17,FIt means that the values used to decide
OL,18,Fwhat households will pay will remain
OL,19,Fbased on house prices from 23 years
OL,20,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
