OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax revaluation to be
OL,4,Adelayed in Wales to 2032
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to delay a revaluation was
OL,7,Fattacked by the respected Institute for
OL,8,FFiscal Studies (IFS) think tank, who
OL,9,Fsaid the reasoning behind it was
OL,10,F"nonsensical" and "absurd".
